### =====================================================================
### Lab04 – A02 Security Misconfiguration (CWE-16, CWE-209, CWE-942, CWE-693)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab04-misconfiguration.md
### Za provjeru popravka pokrenite aplikaciju u produkcijskom načinu:
###   dotnet run --project src/VulnShop.Api --launch-profile http-production
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Ping – pogledajte zaglavlja odgovora (ranjivo: nema X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, CSP)
GET {{host}}/api/lab04/ping

### 2) NAPAD: debug endpoint otkriva cijelu konfiguraciju, uključujući Payment:ApiKey
GET {{host}}/api/lab04/debug/config

### 3) NAPAD: greška otkriva stack trace, nazive klasa i interne podatke (i u Productionu!)
GET {{host}}/api/lab04/crash

### 4) NAPAD: CORS preflight sa zlonamjernog origina – ranjivo: Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://evil.example
OPTIONS {{host}}/api/lab04/ping
Origin: https://evil.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### 5) NAPAD: obični CORS zahtjev s vjerodajnicama
GET {{host}}/api/lab04/ping
Origin: https://evil.example

### 6) Health check – mora raditi i nakon popravka
GET {{host}}/health

### 7) PROVJERA POPRAVKA (profil http-production): 2) → 404, 3) → 500 s generičkom porukom,
###    4) → bez Access-Control-Allow-Origin, 1) → sigurnosna zaglavlja prisutna
GET {{host}}/api/lab04/debug/config
